  "rulesDicesheetTurn": "2 to 4 play on one device, taking turns.\nRoll all five dice. You may roll up to three times.\nBefore the 2nd and 3rd roll, tap the dice you want to keep. Roll the others again.\nThen write what the dice score into exactly one empty box of your sheet. The sheet shows you how many points each box gives.\nIf nothing fits, cross out a box: it gets 0.",
