  "rulesDicesheetExtraFives": "Another Five of a Kind when that box already holds 50: {bonus} extra points. Once the Five of a Kind box is filled (even with 0), a Five of a Kind is a joker: into the top box of its number first; if that is full, into a free bottom box at full points; otherwise into a top box with 0.",
